{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017bXfV21AH3LhiiNqxfGMGv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Writer 4 — IDAStarFinder + All JumpPoint Finders\n2\t\n3\t## Scope\n4\tIDAStarFinder and the entire JumpPoint family: factory, base, and all 4 diagonal-movement variants.\n5\t\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\t## Priority 1 — src/finders/JPFAlwaysMoveDiagonally.js (HIGH — entire file untested)\n9\t\n10\t- `_jump` — diagonal forced-neighbor detection (line 43-51)\n11\t- `_jump` — horizontal forced neighbors (line 56-59)\n12\t- `_jump` — vertical forced neighbors (line 61-64)\n13\t- `_jump` — end-node detection, out-of-bounds/unwalkable returns null\n14\t- `_findNeighbors` — diagonal, horizontal, vertical parent directions + no parent\n15\t- End-to-end `findPath` on maze\n16\t- No-path scenario → `[]`\n17\t- `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n18\t\n19\t## Priority 2 — src/finders/JPFMoveDiagonallyIfNoObstacles.js (HIGH — entire file untested)\n20\t\n21\t- `_jump` — diagonal sub-jump calls (line 49)\n22\t- `_jump` — horizontal forced neighbors (line 56-59)\n23\t- `_jump` — vertical forced neighbors (line 62-65)\n24\t- `_jump` — diagonal continuation gating (`isWalkableAt(x+dx,y) && isWalkableAt(x,y+dy)`) at line 75\n25\t- `_findNeighbors` — all parent-direction branches\n26\t- End-to-end `findPath` on maze\n27\t- No-path scenario → `[]`\n28\t\n29\t## Priority 3 — src/finders/IDAStarFinder.js (HIGH)\n30\t\n31\t- `timeLimit` option — path not found due to time expiry → `[]` (IDAStarFinder.js:105-108)\n32\t- `trackRecursion: true` — `retainCount` and `tested` tracking branches (IDAStarFinder.js:137-144)\n33\t- `weight` != 1\n34\t- Custom heuristic\n35\t- Diagonal movement variants\n36\t- No-path scenario → `[]`\n37\t- The `route` array construction (IDAStarFinder.js:118-121)\n38\t\n39\t## Priority 4 — src/finders/JumpPointFinder.js factory (HIGH)\n40\t\n41\t- `DiagonalMovement.Always` → `JPFAlwaysMoveDiagonally` — verify correct class selected\n42\t- `DiagonalMovement.OnlyWhenNoObstacles` → `JPFMoveDiagonallyIfNoObstacles` — verify correct class\n43\t- Default (no option) → falls through to `JPFMoveDiagonallyIfAtMostOneObstacle`\n44\t\n45\t## Priority 5 — src/finders/JPFNeverMoveDiagonally.js (HIGH)\n46\t\n47\t- `_jump` — horizontal forced-neighbor detection (line 42-45)\n48\t- `_jump` — vertical + recursive horizontal sub-jumps (line 53)\n49\t- `_jump` — `throw new Error(\"Only horizontal and vertical movements are allowed\")` (line 58)\n50\t- `_jump` — `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n51\t- `_findNeighbors` — horizontal, vertical, no parent\n52\t- No-path scenario → `[]`\n53\t\n54\t## Priority 6 — src/finders/JPFMoveDiagonallyIfAtMostOneObstacle.js (HIGH)\n55\t\n56\t- `_jump` — diagonal forced-neighbor detection (line 43-47)\n57\t- `_jump` — diagonal continuation gating null-return when both blocked (line 71)\n58\t- `_jump` — `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n59\t- `_findNeighbors` — diagonal parent forced-neighbor additions (lines 110-115)\n60\t- `_findNeighbors` — horizontal parent forced-obstacle-adjacent diagonal neighbors\n61\t- `_findNeighbors` — no parent\n62\t- No-path scenario → `[]`\n63\t\n64\t## Priority 7 — src/finders/JumpPointFinderBase.js (MEDIUM)\n65\t\n66\t- `_identifySuccessors` — `jumpNode.closed` skip branch (line 89)\n67\t- `_identifySuccessors` — `openList.updateItem` branch (ng < jumpNode.g, line 107)\n68\t- `trackJumpRecursion: true` option\n69\t- No-path scenario (open list exhausted) → `[]`\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bfd406a-bcbf-46e9-94cd-7d94d75bdc54","uuid":"60bc029a-74ed-4f86-968b-a76492d5a5d1","timestamp":"2026-04-16T14:01:37.979Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/sagar/template-repo/docs/experiments/001-demo-artifacts/fleets/fleet-01-test-blitz/workers/test-writer-4/input/assignments.md","content":"# Test Writer 4 — IDAStarFinder + All JumpPoint Finders\n\n## Scope\nIDAStarFinder and the entire JumpPoint family: factory, base, and all 4 diagonal-movement variants.\n\n---\n\n## Priority 1 — src/finders/JPFAlwaysMoveDiagonally.js (HIGH — entire file untested)\n\n- `_jump` — diagonal forced-neighbor detection (line 43-51)\n- `_jump` — horizontal forced neighbors (line 56-59)\n- `_jump` — vertical forced neighbors (line 61-64)\n- `_jump` — end-node detection, out-of-bounds/unwalkable returns null\n- `_findNeighbors` — diagonal, horizontal, vertical parent directions + no parent\n- End-to-end `findPath` on maze\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n\n## Priority 2 — src/finders/JPFMoveDiagonallyIfNoObstacles.js (HIGH — entire file untested)\n\n- `_jump` — diagonal sub-jump calls (line 49)\n- `_jump` — horizontal forced neighbors (line 56-59)\n- `_jump` — vertical forced neighbors (line 62-65)\n- `_jump` — diagonal continuation gating (`isWalkableAt(x+dx,y) && isWalkableAt(x,y+dy)`) at line 75\n- `_findNeighbors` — all parent-direction branches\n- End-to-end `findPath` on maze\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n\n## Priority 3 — src/finders/IDAStarFinder.js (HIGH)\n\n- `timeLimit` option — path not found due to time expiry → `[]` (IDAStarFinder.js:105-108)\n- `trackRecursion: true` — `retainCount` and `tested` tracking branches (IDAStarFinder.js:137-144)\n- `weight` != 1\n- Custom heuristic\n- Diagonal movement variants\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- The `route` array construction (IDAStarFinder.js:118-121)\n\n## Priority 4 — src/finders/JumpPointFinder.js factory (HIGH)\n\n- `DiagonalMovement.Always` → `JPFAlwaysMoveDiagonally` — verify correct class selected\n- `DiagonalMovement.OnlyWhenNoObstacles` → `JPFMoveDiagonallyIfNoObstacles` — verify correct class\n- Default (no option) → falls through to `JPFMoveDiagonallyIfAtMostOneObstacle`\n\n## Priority 5 — src/finders/JPFNeverMoveDiagonally.js (HIGH)\n\n- `_jump` — horizontal forced-neighbor detection (line 42-45)\n- `_jump` — vertical + recursive horizontal sub-jumps (line 53)\n- `_jump` — `throw new Error(\"Only horizontal and vertical movements are allowed\")` (line 58)\n- `_jump` — `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n- `_findNeighbors` — horizontal, vertical, no parent\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n\n## Priority 6 — src/finders/JPFMoveDiagonallyIfAtMostOneObstacle.js (HIGH)\n\n- `_jump` — diagonal forced-neighbor detection (line 43-47)\n- `_jump` — diagonal continuation gating null-return when both blocked (line 71)\n- `_jump` — `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n- `_findNeighbors` — diagonal parent forced-neighbor additions (lines 110-115)\n- `_findNeighbors` — horizontal parent forced-obstacle-adjacent diagonal neighbors\n- `_findNeighbors` — no parent\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n\n## Priority 7 — src/finders/JumpPointFinderBase.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- `_identifySuccessors` — `jumpNode.closed` skip branch (line 89)\n- `_identifySuccessors` — `openList.updateItem` branch (ng < jumpNode.g, line 107)\n- `trackJumpRecursion: true` option\n- No-path scenario (open list exhausted) → `[]`\n","numLines":70,"startLine":1,"totalLines":70}}}
